<title>PHILIPPINES: PNB 96 net 1.708 bln net of one-time gains.</title>
<headline>PNB 96 net 1.708 bln net of one-time gains.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine National Bank's (PNB) senior executive vice president Valentin Araneta told Reuters on Thursday the bank posted a net profit of 1.708 billion pesos in 1996.</p>
<p>The figure was net of extraordinary gains, Araneta said ahead of an analysts briefing where detailed figures were due to be released.</p>
<p>In 1995, PNB posted a net profit of 2.058 billion pesos.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
</text>
